{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":494734,"name":"kk huang","username":"kk_huang","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/k/9f8e36/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T08:25:03.889Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494734-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494734-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494734-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494734-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEmail ticket T-F83906. No reply for two days after they said a teammate would follow up.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows Grok Bot 0.53.0\u003cbr\u003e\nSettings → General account:\u003cbr\u003e\nCursor\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#user_01M2HJWFE70CZV04EGC6D37XS7\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nGmail never appears.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMain window: cannot reach your computer.\u003cbr\u003e\nRetry / Recover do nothing. Update and Reset fail or are unavailable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSame Google account on iPhone Grok Bot works\u003cbr\u003e\n(kk huang, the Gmail used for SuperGrok).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlready tried:\u003cbr\u003e\nsign out and sign in\u003cbr\u003e\nreboot\u003cbr\u003e\nrename AppData folders\u003cbr\u003e\nuninstall and reinstall\u003cbr\u003e\nsign in with another browser\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ecurl to the Agent Computer host returns HTTP 404 and Server awselb 2.0\u003cbr\u003e\nso this PC can reach the cloud host.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease reattach the Windows session to the existing computer.\u003cbr\u003e\nDo not Reset the cloud computer. Phone is working.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScreenshots attached.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494734-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494734-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSign in to Windows Grok Bot 0.53.0 with the same Google account used on iPhone.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Settings, General. Account shows Cursor \u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#user_01M2HJWFE70CZV04EGC6D37XS7\u003c/span\u003e, not Gmail.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMain window says cannot reach your computer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRetry and Recover do nothing. Update and Reset fail or are unavailable.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eiPhone Grok Bot on the same account works.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494734-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494734-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSettings should show the Gmail address. Windows should attach to the same Agent Computer that already works on iPhone.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494734-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494734-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/4/d40e16ccb7a921dfa2024996ed2d2d6a0d500606.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/ufVpnLN9IScdosZWWVTkVu0zW74.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"1789530459800.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/4/d40e16ccb7a921dfa2024996ed2d2d6a0d500606_2_677x500.jpeg\" alt=\"1789530459800.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"ufVpnLN9IScdosZWWVTkVu0zW74\" width=\"677\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/4/d40e16ccb7a921dfa2024996ed2d2d6a0d500606_2_677x500.jpeg, https://us1.disc