2 88.1 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/9/f/9ff19c9be5e27338779a416f2d75220a0d9a6b72.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/mOVzfGtVi3wzPpZ8vfqI5oD7sv8.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"174E6369-1B87-4FB9-953D-86BCF0A1342E.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/9/f/9ff19c9be5e27338779a416f2d75220a0d9a6b72_2_230x500.jpeg\" alt=\"174E6369-1B87-4FB9-953D-86BCF0A1342E.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"mOVzfGtVi3wzPpZ8vfqI5oD7sv8\" width=\"230\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/9/f/9ff19c9be5e27338779a416f2d75220a0d9a6b72_2_230x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/9/f/9ff19c9be5e27338779a416f2d75220a0d9a6b72_2_345x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/9/f/9ff19c9be5e27338779a416f2d75220a0d9a6b72_2_460x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EDEEED\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003e174E6369-1B87-4FB9-953D-86BCF0A1342E.jpg\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1290×2796 201 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494734-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494734-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494734-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494734-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot Windows 0.53.0\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: Windows 10/11\u003cbr\u003e\nPhone (working): Grok Bot iOS, same Google account\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-494734-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-494734-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T08:27:54.407Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":16,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":81.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":172120,"topic_slug":"windows-grok-bot-wont-reach-the-cloud-computer","display_username":"kk huang","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":3,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138537,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/windows-grok-bot-wont-reach-the-cloud-computer/172120/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":494798,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T09:14:25.461Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report, and sorry for the delay on the ticket.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFirst, the good news: your Windows app is logged into the exact same account as your iPhone, and the Agent Computer itself looks fine since your phone can talk to it. You don’t need to reset or reconnect anything, so please don’t click Reset or Recover.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s happening: the Windows app completes sign-in, but its other requests from that PC are not reaching our servers. That’s why it can’t load your profile, so you see an ID instead of your Gmail, and why it can’t reach your computer. In most cases, this means something on the PC is inspecting or blocking HTTPS traffic. Usually it’s encrypted connections scanning in an antivirus, or a proxy or VPN tool. Your browser and \u003ccode\u003ecurl\u003c/code\u003e still work because they trust the Windows certificate store, but the Grok Bot app does not. So this isn’t an account setup issue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease try these steps:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOn this PC, open \u003ca href=\"https://api2.cursor.sh\"\u003ehttps://api2.cursor.sh\u003c/a\u003e in Edge or Chrome, click the lock icon, and check who issued the certificate. It should say Amazon RSA 2048 M01. If you see an antivirus name or a company name there, that’s the cause.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIf you have Kaspersky, ESET, Avast, Bitdefender, Norton, or Trend Micro, disable encrypted connections scanning, or add Grok Bot to the exclusions for encrypted traffic scanning. Pause any VPN or proxy tools like Clash, v2ray, WARP, and make sure Windows Settings → Network \u0026amp; Internet → Proxy is off.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit Grok Bot from the tray right click the icon then Quit, relaunch it, and wait a couple of minutes.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIf it still won’t connect, test once on your phone’s mobile hotspot with the same settings.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know what the certificate issuer shows, what antivirus and VPN you’re using, and whether step 3 or 4 helped. If nothing helped, attach the file \u003ccode\u003e%APPDATA%\\Grok Bot\\desktop-structured-log-spill.v1.json\u003c/code\u003e and I’ll dig deeper.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne more thing: access is currently via free trial. If you have SuperGrok, please check that it’s linked at \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com/promos/super-grok\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eCursor - The best way to code with AI\u003c/a\u003e so you don’t lose access when the trial ends and confuse it with this issue.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T09:14:25.461Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":0.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":172120,"topic_slug":"windows-grok-bot-wont-reach-the-cloud-computer","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://api2.cursor.sh","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":2},{"url":"http://cursor.com/promos/super-grok","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Cursor - The best way to code with AI","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/windows-grok-bot-wont-reach-the-cloud-computer/172120/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[494734,494798]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,1]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":325,"name":"windows","slug":"windows"},{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":305,"name":"login","slug":"login"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Windows Grok Bot won\u0026rsquo;t reach the cloud computer","id":172120,"title":"Windows Grok Bot won't reach the cloud computer","posts_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-18T08:25:03.861Z","views":23,"reply_count":0,"like_count":0,"last_posted_at":"2026-09-18T09:14:25.461Z","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"has_summary":false,"archetype":"regular","slug":"windows-grok-bot-wont-reach-the-cloud-computer","category_id":6,"word_count":669,"deleted_at":null,"user_id":138537,"featured_link":null,"pinned_globally":false,"pinned_at":null,"pinned_until":null,"image_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/4/d40e16ccb7a921dfa2024996ed2d2d6a0d500606_2_1024x755.jpeg","slow_mode_seconds":0,"draft":null,"draft_key":"topic_172120","draft_sequence":null,"unpinned":null,"pinned":false,"current_post_number":1,"highest_post_number":5,"deleted_by":null,"actions_summary":[{"id":4,"count":0,"hidden":false,"can_act":false},{"id":8,"count":0,"hidden":false,"can_act":false},{"id":10,"count":0,"hidden":false,"can_act":false},{"id":7,"count":0,"hidden":false,"can_act":false}],"chunk_size":20,"bookmarked":false,"topic_timer":{"id":32994,"execute_at":"2026-10-18T09:14:25.461Z","duration_minutes":43200,"based_on_last_post":true,"status_type":"close","category_id":null},"message_bus_last_id":21,"participant_count":2,"show_read_indicator":false,"thumbnails":[{"max_width":null,"max_height":null,"width":1035,"height":764,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/4/d40e16ccb7a921dfa2024996ed2d2d6a0d500606.jpeg"},{"max_width":1024,"max